Question: Sorrento Therapeutics terminated its phase 2 COVI-MSC trial NCT04903327. Why did it stop, and were the results ever posted or published?

Snapshot date: 2026-11-05
Research notes: none

Findings:
[{"lane": "trials", "round": 1, "brief": "Investigate trial NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC) sponsored by Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. It was terminated around November 2022 with 43 patients enrolled. The registry reason is 'Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets'. Confirm the current status on ClinicalTrials.gov, whether results are posted, the results due date, and if there are any recent registry updates or posted data.", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC), sponsored by Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc., has an overall status of TERMINATED.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed via live ClinicalTrials.gov record and snapshot table."}, {"claim": "The trial stated why_stopped reason is 'Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets', categorized under enrollment.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Exact quote from registry record."}, {"claim": "The trial started on November 16, 2021, achieved primary completion on August 29, 2022, and reached final completion on November 23, 2022, with an enrollment of 43 patients.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Dates and enrollment confirmed."}, {"claim": "No results are posted on ClinicalTrials.gov for NCT04903327.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "results_posted is false and results_first_post_date is null."}, {"claim": "The results due date for NCT04903327 was August 29, 2023, making it significantly late.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Results due date calculated based on primary completion date plus one year."}, {"claim": "The last update date on ClinicalTrials.gov for NCT04903327 is January 9, 2023.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "No more recent registry updates found."}, {"claim": "No Drugs@FDA application was found for COVI-MSC.", "evidence_ids": ["fda:none:covi-msc"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Searched Drugs@FDA with get_fda_approvals."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 1, "brief": "Investigate SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. (CIK 0000850261) from November 2022 through mid-2023. Look for mentions of NCT04903327, COVI-MSC, or the termination of this COVID-19 stem cell program. Determine if the sponsor gave details about the termination to investors or if the program was quietly phased out amid their financial restructuring and bankruptcy proceedings.", "findings": [{"claim": "Ran out of turns. Records gathered: ctgov:NCT04903327, sec:0001104659-21-075372, sec:0001104659-21-102102, sec:0001104659-21-103236, sec:0001104659-21-114999, sec:0001104659-21-135227, sec:0001104659-21-144129, sec:0001104659-22-002318, sec:0001104659-22-010294, sec:0001104659-22-024646, sec:0001104659-23-023902, sec:0001104659-23-034065, sec:0001104659-23-039478.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327", "sec:0001104659-21-075372", "sec:0001104659-21-102102", "sec:0001104659-21-103236", "sec:0001104659-21-114999", "sec:0001104659-21-135227", "sec:0001104659-21-144129", "sec:0001104659-22-002318", "sec:0001104659-22-010294", "sec:0001104659-22-024646", "sec:0001104659-23-023902", "sec:0001104659-23-034065", "sec:0001104659-23-039478"], "confidence": "low", "notes": ""}], "gaps": ["Researcher hit the 8-turn cap before finishing: Investigate SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. (CIK 0000850261) from November 2022 through mid-2023. Look for mentions of NCT04903327, COVI-MSC, or the termination of this COVID-19 stem cell "]}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Search PubMed and Europe PMC for any publications linked to NCT04903327 or reporting results for COVI-MSC. Note that several review papers (such as PMID 38005826 and 35321737) mention the trial, but check specifically whether there are any primary results papers, abstracts, or preprints reporting clinical data (safety or efficacy) for the 43 patients enrolled in this trial.", "findings": [{"claim": "No primary results papers reporting clinical data for the 43 patients enrolled in trial NCT04903327 were found; all five identified publications (PMID 34831101, PMID 35321737, PMID 35782071, PMID 35897770, PMID 38005826) are review articles or mention the trial via Europe PMC text mining rather than reporting primary trial outcomes.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "All hits are Europe PMC text mentions within review papers discussing stem cell therapy or COVID-19 pathophysiology."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 2, "brief": "Analyze the collected Sorrento Therapeutics SEC filings (CIK 0000850261) from late 2022 to mid-2023, such as the 10-K or 10-Q filings, to search for mentions of COVI-MSC, NCT04903327, or the termination of this clinical program. Determine if the company disclosed specific details about ending this trial or if it was phased out during their Chapter 11 bankruptcy filing in early 2023.\n\n(Gap to close: SEC filings search for COVI-MSC or NCT04903327 termination was cut off due to turn limit.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. (CIK 0000850261) was identified as the sponsor for NCT04903327.", "evidence_ids": ["cik:0000850261"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "CIK found via get_trial_filings."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC) was terminated due to considerably slow enrollment and inability to reach enrollment targets.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "From clinicaltrials registry data."}, {"claim": "SEC 8-K filings from February and March 2023 mention COVI-MSC as a product under development by Sorrento Therapeutics, but these mentions appear in standard pipeline/trademark lists rather than detailing the specific trial termination.", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0001104659-23-023902", "sec:0001104659-23-034065", "sec:0001104659-23-039478"], "confidence": "medium", "notes": "Snippets from exhibits list COVI-MSC among therapies against coronaviruses."}], "gaps": ["Full-text search of detailed 10-K and 10-Q filing text for NCT04903327 or specific discontinuation reasons was restricted by external API access limitations (SEC_USER_AGENT configuration error)."]}]

